## About the project

Grace is an artist whose work explores experimentation across different series of ideas, often converging into narrative-driven outcomes. She wanted her portfolio to reflect this spirit of exploration — not just through visuals, but through the digital experience itself.

We collaborated to design and develop a custom portfolio website that showcases her projects through experimental front-end and web animation techniques. Subtle motion, interactive transitions, and dynamic compositions were integrated with her visual work to create an immersive, expressive platform that communicates both her creative process and a strong professional presence.

